;; own algorithms. log2, log10, exp2, cbrt, erf and erfc are musl's too (PY6g's patch branches for the Haskell owner);
;; gamma and lgamma CPython's own Lanczos code (m_tgamma, m_lgamma), with the rest of its C-level algorithms in
;; math_extra.go (PY6g).

